  "assumptions": [
    "SEEDED: every JVM job ran `-s <seed>` (seeds recorded per job), and with this Forge build identical inputs reproduce the logs byte for byte — game g of job j replays as `-n g -s <seed_j>`. Still a sample of N games: the interval is the claim, the seed is the receipt.",
